+Event-based collectors also keep a bounded local ledger of hashed event identities and exact
+aggregate usage tuples. The ledger contains no provider IDs or transcript content, survives source
+file replacement, truncation, moves, and deleted local history, and is retained when a stable local
+source is paired to a different account. A conflicting tuple keeps the first accepted value and
+marks the collection partial; unrelated valid events remain eligible for collection.
